{# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   THE THREE TIERS (W2b §2.1) — three answers to "what counts as a winner?",
   NOT three severities and not three confidence levels. Order is LAW:
   narrowest bar first, never re-ordered by count or by anything nightly.
   Tiers carry NO hue — on this page colour means wear, and a tier is not a
   severity. They are distinguished by position, name and size only.
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #}
{% set TIER_META = {
  'primary': {'slug':'six-month',
    'en':'Big six-month gains', 'zh':'半年大涨',
    'def_en':'Up 50% or more over six months.',
    'def_zh':'半年内上涨 50% 或以上。',
