    'ord_en':'Inside a group, the largest six-month gain comes first. That is a fact about the past — not a ranking.',
    'ord_zh':'每组内部按半年涨幅从大到小排列。那只是关于过去的事实 —— 不是排名。',
    'not_en':'A few checks need a longer price history than some names have. Where a check cannot be made, it is not counted as clear — it is simply not counted.',
    'not_zh':'有几项检查需要较长的价格历史，部分个股并不具备。无法完成的检查不会被当作「没问题」，它只是没有计入。'},
  'r63': {'slug':'three-month',
    'en':'Fast three-month runs', 'zh':'三个月急涨',
    'def_en':'Up 35% or more over the last three months.',
    'def_zh':'近三个月上涨 35% 或以上。',
    'cap_en':'in three months', 'cap_zh':'近三个月',
    'bar_en':'Up 35% or more over the last three months, and within 10% of its highest close in the past year.',
