    'def_zh':'股价高出自身 200 日均价的幅度，至少相当于它自己 6 个交易日的正常波动。',
    'cap_en':'above trend', 'cap_zh':'高于均线',
    'bar_en':'At least six of its own typical daily moves above its 200-day average price, and within 10% of its highest close in the past year.',
    'bar_zh':'股价高出自身 200 日均价的幅度至少相当于它自己 6 个交易日的正常波动，且收盘价在过去一年最高收盘价的 10% 以内。',
    'ord_en':'Inside a group, names run A to Z by ticker so you can find yours. That is not a ranking either.',
    'ord_zh':'每组内部按代码 A 到 Z 排列，方便你找到自己的持仓。这同样不是排名。',
    'not_en':'How much a name gained over the past year is left out here — in runs like these it points the other way. Where any other check cannot be made, it is not counted as clear either.',
